Add a "Broken links" control panel page that reads the report from the `@linkchecker` endpoint: a filterable, paginated table of the broken links found in site contents, plus a CSV download that honours the active filters. Since the check runs out of band (from cron), the page states when the list was generated and, when it needs refreshing, tells the reader to ask the site managers; a report that has never run is told apart from one that found nothing.
